<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-10T23:36:32.342Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:36:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran troops are conducting strikes in Haiti, killing gang leader Mathias Saintil and demolishing the mansion of a 400‑member Mawozo gang leader. The Salvadoran president has warned Haitian gang leaders that his forces will finish them as in El Salvador, while Haitian leaders travel to El Salvador to discuss the offensive. Regional leaders, including the Dominican president, have voiced support for the Salvadoran deployment and called for better coordination of forces. Amnesty International has urged that the deployment respect human rights. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQTzM1SUxvakZDNV9scm9PYXg4bDVJOE5BZnI1dFlqZ3p5cG1oTVVFNHFWcTQ1N1c3enhQWGU5Ym5uNzd0NjBWbmlxU1ZsOHlaRnI3Qko5dFFzbXcyY3l2N3AxZl9faldvOUJlWXVpVkhEZGQ4QVY4T2o5MG9SRTdTSnQtMkJRdUU2cjdpYlVKY2dCZHJRUnNNTzgtS1ZXamR3WHpuRWhWU1FKYnVDQ0s2VjRiTHIwZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPanQyNmxhM0ZCZ1ltQVFqeHVZY3NncFlFc3BvcmVUUWY2RmJpQ0REOFJnWUM2Z2o0MDJMN1AwVVRaR05HOUo2QUpHbW1XUUQtRlZsRkhwTEppOVM1NmZuQmphcTFyaW1kNE95blZTZVBBX25ldFg3M3V5RHJSdEx0T3paT08yNnNESmVScDc1WkRrV1RyVjAyYTdUUnRyRGw1?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Killeen Daily Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNY2toRWVFb212Vi1tSTdHZzgwUlBVVjRkbGJOYnVMcGlxWlFRWFYzWXE5YUQ1Si1tNWpiRnZmVUZhWjY1ZnpRWVlJS2dBVEdqRkpmaXlsdTJGaGpENy1McjlmYkdSdU9oeThxOG85dTc2eVJyTXRGUVhSTkxwOU5YQ3RENy0wMmgxY3lrbThrakljRktsRmRaVmFSX2hPVkJvdFAtZFBpZlFtenNEYzJkYkhobDJVeXZ4MGJLWm9vZy12dkRN?oc=5&quot;&gt;lenouvelliste.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.go